ts, 3 rebounds, +10 in 4 minutes. Made the most of his opportunity. Good stuff."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 6, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:13:28.969Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxy7wk26s2a", "cid": "bafyreigfye2bxy4fan56xc57asf6upr3x5mnxpcilvdc43ptg5xrbymi2u", "author": {"did": "did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo", "handle": "philiprr.bsky.social", "displayName": "Philip Rossman-Reich", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/bafkreia5yytn63svxtqdkdptgsmyydn6pq4k5kko77upzeyupxjbgkwkke", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-08-18T16:37:49.540Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-29T00:13:15.599Z", "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Magic"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 10, "byteStart": 4}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 182, "byteStart": 174}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag", "tag": "Raptors"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 215, "byteStart": 207}}], "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreiayuf4vuc7ucfr6zrrt6dj4gpxhesbwfyaeuqnoi5yo6ywsl5be5q", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxxvnfn3c2a"}, "root": {"cid": "bafyreigjyqwct2o2cay4qdfwgcttbip6thbc7wooqzns3rq4typazgbqma", "uri": "at://did:plc:fkpnckg4eqizwxmgrxrgwyxo/app.bsky.feed.post/3myxvqv44lk2a"}}, "text": "The #Magic had a nine-point lead, then they broke the lineup and the offense ground to a halt. Not making the outside shots, turning it over and fouling. Easy way to let the #Raptors feast. 19-4 run for the #Raptors and they lead 32-25 after one quarter."}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-29T00:13:16.083Z", "labels": []}, {